# TypeScript script authoring

- Author repository automation under `scripts/**` in TypeScript/Node 22.
- The legacy shell estate is retired. Do not add `.ps1`, `.psm1`, `.psd1`, shell
  compatibility wrappers, executable probes, or fallback routes for removed behavior.
- A future task that intentionally changes this terminal architecture must say so
  explicitly and own the corresponding retirement/evidence changes.

Canonical policy: [`docs/architecture.md`](../../docs/architecture.md#typescript-script-authoring).
